 microRNA-134 for the treatment of seizure-related disorders and other neurologic injuries (US 9,803,200 B2). J.W., M.A.J., and M.T.M. are employees of F Hoffman-La Roche Ltd. All other authors have no competing interests.</CoiStatement></MedlineCitation><PubmedData><History><PubMedPubDate PubStatus="received"><Year>2021</Year><Month>8</Month><Day>17</Day></PubMedPubDate><PubMedPubDate PubStatus="accepted"><Year>2022</Year><Month>4</Month><Day>15</Day></PubMedPubDate><PubMedPubDate PubStatus="entrez"><Year>2022</Year><Month>5</Month><Day>20</Day><Hour>2</Hour><Minute>25</Minute></PubMedPubDate><PubMedPubDate PubStatus="pubmed"><Year>2022</Year><Month>5</Month><Day>21</Day><Hour>6</Hour><Minute>0</Minute></PubMedPubDate><PubMedPubDate PubStatus="medline"><Year>2022</Year><Month>5</Month><Day>21</Day><Hour>6</Hour><Minute>1</Minute></PubMedPubDate><PubMedPubDate PubStatus="pmc-release"><Year>2022</Year><Month>4</Month><Day>20</Day></PubMedPubDate></History><PublicationStatus>epublish</PublicationStatus><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">35592499</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pmc">PMC9092865</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1016/j.omtn.2022.04.009</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pii">S2162-2531(22)00085-3</ArticleId></ArticleIdList><ReferenceList><Reference><Citation>Buiting K., Williams C., Horsthemke B. Angelman syndrome - insights into a rare neurogenetic disorder. Nat. Rev. Neurol. 2016;12:584&#x2013;593. doi: 10.1038/nrneurol.2016.133.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1038/nrneurol.2016.133</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">27615419</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Pelc K., Boyd S.G., Cheron G., Dan B. Epilepsy in Angelman syndrome. Seizure. 2008;17:211&#x2013;217. doi: 10.1016/j.seizure.2007.08.004.</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1016/j.seizure.2007.08.004</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">17904873</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Margolis S.S., Sell G.