16
47&#x2013;54. 10.1016/S0896-6273(00)80022-80027</Citation><ArticleIdList><ArticleId IdType="doi">10.1016/S0896-6273(00)80022-80027</ArticleId><ArticleId IdType="pubmed">8562089</ArticleId></ArticleIdList></Reference><Reference><Citation>Zhang X., Zhang H., Oberdick J. (2002). Conservation of the developmentally regulated dendritic localization of a Purkinje cell-specific mRNA that encodes a G-protein modulator: comparison of rodent and human Pcp2(L7) gene structure and expression.
